      "THE DASHBOARD IT OPENS ON (\u201cthe RM stock as of today, the WIP stock as of today, the total inventory up to now \u2026 also show stock class A, class B, and class C. What is the total number of items, the total number of quantities, and the total value\u201d). Read live off the ERP\u2019s Bin: RM (the Stock warehouses), WIP and total \u2014 value, items, quantity \u2014 then finished goods, at vendors, and what sits in warehouses nobody has typed. RM by class: items in the class, items holding stock, quantity, value, share. The largest warehouses. Non-moving parts are next.",
