      "THE SUSPENSE (\u201cput a suspense entry where the suspense entry will make it match \u2026 It would have gone into WIP, or it could have gone into utilisation \u2026 in the movement, we need to find a method where we can start synchronising the real stock and start releasing the balance\u201d). Every variance opens a suspense line \u2014 Genie\u2019s ledger, not the ERP\u2019s \u2014 so the books can be read as the shelf says. THE METHOD: after a count, an ERP entry posted for a date after the count is a real movement and moves shelf and books together; an entry made after the count but posted for a date on or before it (a back-dated issue to WIP, a late GRN) or any Stock Reconciliation is the books catching up, and \u21c4 Sync with ERP releases the suspense by it, in the direction that closes the gap, citing the voucher. Anything else is released by hand with the reason: WIP, consumption, unrecorded receipt, scrap, UOM. Nothing is posted into the ERP.",
